---
import { Blockquote, Code, Codeblock } from "@teseor/react";
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Blockquote — Teseor">
  <main class="t-stack" data-gap="6">
    <h1>Blockquote</h1>
    <p>Quoted-text primitive — styled `&lt;blockquote&gt;` with accent border and prose spacing. Source attribution composes via a `&lt;cite&gt;` child; native `cite` HTML attr (URL) passes through the inherited type.</p>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Examples</h2>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>default</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <Blockquote>Blockquote</Blockquote>
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;Blockquote&gt;Blockquote&lt;/Blockquote&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>subtle</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <Blockquote variant="subtle">Blockquote</Blockquote>
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;Blockquote variant="subtle"&gt;Blockquote&lt;/Blockquote&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Props</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Responsive</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>asChild</Code></td><td><Code>boolean</Code></td><td></td><td><Code>false</Code></td><td>Render the trigger directly on the consumer's child element (cloneElement) instead of wrapping in a &lt;span&gt;. Single-child invariant; the child receives the wrapper's &lt;code&gt;style&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;data-state&lt;/code&gt;, event handlers, and any ARIA attributes the component applies (component-specific). Not compatible with Astro slots — use the default wrapper there.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Variants</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>default</Code></td><td>Left accent border, standard color; for hero pull quotes and prose emphasis.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>subtle</Code></td><td>Italic text without a border; for compact in-prose citations.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Tokens</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Fallback</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-blockquote-fg</Code></td><td><Code>--t-on-bg</Code></td><td>Default text color.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-blockquote-fg-muted</Code></td><td><Code>--t-on-surface-muted</Code></td><td>Color for the `&lt;cite&gt;` attribution child.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-blockquote-border-color</Code></td><td><Code>--t-accent</Code></td><td>Color of the left accent rule on the default variant.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-blockquote-border-width</Code></td><td><Code>--t-border-thick</Code></td><td>Width of the left accent rule on the default variant.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-blockquote-pad-inline</Code></td><td><Code>--t-space-4</Code></td><td>Inline padding inside the blockquote, from the border to the text.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-blockquote-spacing-block</Code></td><td><Code>--t-space-4</Code></td><td>Vertical rhythm above and below the blockquote in prose context.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Forced colors</h2>
      <p>In Windows High Contrast mode, the component remaps these semantic tokens to CSS system colors. Custom-property inheritance carries the values to every reference in the subtree.</p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Default</th><th>Forced-colors</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-accent</Code></td><td><Code>oklch(from oklch(58% 0.2 268deg) 55% c h)</Code></td><td><Code>ButtonText</Code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-on-bg</Code></td><td><Code>oklch(from oklch(from oklch(58% 0.2 268deg) 50% calc(c * 0.025) h) 18% c h)</Code></td><td><Code>CanvasText</Code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-on-surface-muted</Code></td><td><Code>oklch(from oklch(from oklch(58% 0.2 268deg) 50% calc(c * 0.025) h) 18% c h)</Code></td><td><Code>CanvasText</Code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Bundle size</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Artifact</th><th>Raw</th><th>Gzip</th><th>Brotli</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/teseor/teseor/blob/main/packages/css/src/components/blockquote/blockquote.css"><Code>@teseor/css/components/blockquote.css</Code></a></td><td>1.42 KB</td><td>0.54 KB</td><td>0.49 KB</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
